      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "I can help, but first I need to authenticate you and then check your order status.\n\nAlso, note: exchanges in our system can only switch to a different **option of the same product type** (you generally can’t exchange a bookshelf into a completely different product type like a camera).\n\nTo get started, please reply with:\n1) The **email** you used when ordering, and  \n2) Your **order id** (e.g., `#W0000000`)  \n\nOnce I look up the order, I’ll confirm whether a same-product-type exchange is possible and whether we can keep it **at or under** what you paid.",
